WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:02.567
-Welcome to "Late Night,"
everybody.

00:00:02.567 --> 00:00:03.901
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:03.901 --> 00:00:06.100
How's everybody doing?
All right.

00:00:06.100 --> 00:00:08.634
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:08.634 --> 00:00:11.033
In that case,
let's get to the news.

00:00:11.033 --> 00:00:15.400
I mean, those of us
who still can.

00:00:15.400 --> 00:00:16.667
Fox News announced today

00:00:16.667 --> 00:00:19.033
that it has parted ways
with host Tucker Carlson,

00:00:19.033 --> 00:00:20.634
and last Friday
was his final show,

00:00:20.634 --> 00:00:23.100
which is great
but also unsettling,

00:00:23.100 --> 00:00:25.767
at least when he had a show,
we knew where he was.

00:00:25.767 --> 00:00:28.868
It's creepy trying
to fall asleep

00:00:28.868 --> 00:00:31.000
with a ventriloquist dummy
in your room,

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:32.968
but it's way creepier
when you wake up

00:00:32.968 --> 00:00:35.968
and it's not there anymore.

00:00:35.968 --> 00:00:37.868
"Huh, that's weird.

00:00:37.868 --> 00:00:40.901
Oh, my God, is it behind me?"

00:00:40.901 --> 00:00:44.167
Also today, CNN parted ways
with anchor Don Lemon

00:00:44.167 --> 00:00:46.334
amid accusations
of sexist behavior.

00:00:46.334 --> 00:00:49.367
Wow, does anybody have
an opening for a sexist?

00:00:49.367 --> 00:00:50.367
Oh, right.

00:00:52.234 --> 00:00:54.601
So that would...

00:00:54.601 --> 00:00:56.033
President Biden is reportedly

00:00:56.033 --> 00:00:58.033
preparing to formally announce

00:00:58.033 --> 00:00:59.167
he is running for re-election.

00:00:59.167 --> 00:01:02.133
If successful, he will be
the oldest man.

00:01:02.133 --> 00:01:04.534
That's it, just the oldest --

00:01:04.534 --> 00:01:06.400
just the oldest man.

00:01:06.400 --> 00:01:07.501
That's right.

00:01:07.501 --> 00:01:08.667
President Biden
is reportedly planning

00:01:08.667 --> 00:01:10.300
to formally announce
his re-election campaign

00:01:10.300 --> 00:01:11.367
as early as this week,

00:01:11.367 --> 00:01:12.400
which is frankly a little crazy.

00:01:12.400 --> 00:01:14.167
He's gonna be 82.

00:01:14.167 --> 00:01:15.801
I think you should stop
running for president

00:01:15.801 --> 00:01:20.167
when people start saying
"young" after your age.

00:01:20.167 --> 00:01:23.868
Joe here, 82 years young.

00:01:23.868 --> 00:01:27.534
Not only that, the leader of the
free world, that's pretty nuts.

00:01:27.534 --> 00:01:29.834
President Biden met today
with three Tennessee lawmakers

00:01:29.834 --> 00:01:32.567
who led gun safety protests
at the state capitol.

00:01:32.567 --> 00:01:35.601
Meanwhile, Ron DeSantis
met with the guns.

00:01:35.601 --> 00:01:38.434
[ Laughter ]

00:01:38.434 --> 00:01:41.067
Senate Judiciary Chair
Dick Durbin, in a new interview,

00:01:41.067 --> 00:01:44.067
called for a code of conduct
for Supreme Court justices,

00:01:44.067 --> 00:01:49.767
because right now, the only rule
is no front flips off the yacht.

00:01:49.767 --> 00:01:51.400
New Jersey Governor Phil Murphy

00:01:51.400 --> 00:01:53.767
recently declared
that September 23rd

00:01:53.767 --> 00:01:57.100
will be Bruce Springsteen Day,
as opposed to Jersey's previous

00:01:57.100 --> 00:02:01.601
Springsteen Day -- all of them.

00:02:01.601 --> 00:02:03.234
McDonald's has announced
it will offer

00:02:03.234 --> 00:02:06.667
its Big Mac sauce on the side
for dipping or, what the hell,

00:02:06.667 --> 00:02:07.767
soaking.

00:02:10.033 --> 00:02:12.267
New York officials
unveiled a plan today

00:02:12.267 --> 00:02:14.767
to install 10 miles of bike
lanes throughout the city.

00:02:14.767 --> 00:02:15.968
That story again --

00:02:15.968 --> 00:02:18.167
New York officials
are adding 10 more miles

00:02:18.167 --> 00:02:20.567
of sometimes car lanes.

00:02:23.133 --> 00:02:24.801
IKEA announced plans last week

00:02:24.801 --> 00:02:27.267
to open up eight more stores
across the U.S.

00:02:27.267 --> 00:02:29.434
or more likely will start
to build them,

00:02:29.434 --> 00:02:33.267
get frustrated, and give up.

00:02:33.267 --> 00:02:34.734
According to a new study --

00:02:34.734 --> 00:02:37.234
We've all done that,
we've all done it.

00:02:37.234 --> 00:02:39.100
According to a new study,
Americans over 50

00:02:39.100 --> 00:02:40.801
who play video games
feel overlooked

00:02:40.801 --> 00:02:42.234
by the gaming industry.

00:02:42.234 --> 00:02:44.934
For example, there is no option
to play "Grand Theft Auto"

00:02:44.934 --> 00:02:49.567
with your left blinker
on the whole time.

00:02:49.567 --> 00:02:51.534
That's right,
70% of older Americans

00:02:51.534 --> 00:02:53.367
who play video games
do not feel like products

00:02:53.367 --> 00:02:54.667
are designed with them in mind,

00:02:54.667 --> 00:02:57.400
because when they tried it,
they failed miserably.

00:02:57.400 --> 00:03:01.100
[ Crowd murmurs ]

00:03:01.100 --> 00:03:04.868
[ Laughter ]

00:03:04.868 --> 00:03:07.601
And that's sadly because you
can't ever predict

00:03:07.601 --> 00:03:11.367
the future was our final joke
of the monologue.

00:03:11.367 --> 00:03:13.434
You try you usually try
to close on a banger

00:03:13.434 --> 00:03:15.567
and sometimes you close
on one that goes like that.

00:03:15.567 --> 00:03:17.434
[ Laughter ]

00:03:17.434 --> 00:03:18.601
It doesn't matter, though,

00:03:18.601 --> 00:03:19.801
because we've got a great show
for you tonight!

